error[E8009]  c/c.canon:6:52
  open of emit cpp is an empty list: omit open to keep every enum closed

error[E8009]  d/d.canon:6:52
  option open of emit cpp must be a list of enum names

error[E8009]  t/t.canon:6:54
  open of emit ts is an empty list: omit open to keep every enum closed

error[E8009]  u/u.canon:6:54
